Main SWANMERGE changes
----------------------

- Adds a `make merge` build target for `swanmerge.exe`.
- Adds a `-merge` preprocessing switch in `switch.pl`.
- Includes a merge-only `SWMERGE` execution path.
- Includes the non-structured-grid merge ownership assignment used to avoid
  merged NetCDF outputs with only missing values in affected cases.
- Adds wrapper scripts and documentation for building, running, and validating
  merge-only workflows.

